WEBVTT

00:01.440 --> 00:04.780
We will now begin the 57th
expedition beyond the walls!

00:05.820 --> 00:07.720
Onward!

00:12.760 --> 00:18.429
The Survey Corps left to find a route to
Zhiganshina, but encountered a Female Titan,

00:18.429 --> 00:21.667
a transformed human like Eren.

00:28.190 --> 00:29.770
That's no Aberrant.

00:29.770 --> 00:33.898
It's a human in the body of a Titan!

00:40.620 --> 00:43.530
As soldiers died, one after the next,

00:43.530 --> 00:46.545
they headed into a
forest of giant trees,

00:46.571 --> 00:49.338
none of them knowing why.

00:50.260 --> 00:53.930
If Squad Levi doesn't
defeat it, who will?

00:54.670 --> 00:55.560
Choose.

00:56.230 --> 00:57.810
Believe in yourself.

00:58.190 --> 01:01.890
Or believe in the Survey Corps and me.

01:04.660 --> 01:05.940
I'll go forward!

01:11.150 --> 01:13.150
Fire!

01:19.180 --> 01:20.280
Oh, right...

01:20.810 --> 01:22.720
I wanted to ask you something.

01:24.130 --> 01:27.250
Is it okay if we cut off
your hands and legs?

01:27.800 --> 01:29.850
They'll grow back, right?

01:30.420 --> 01:33.050
I'm talking about your
limbs, not the Titan's.

01:33.480 --> 01:37.350
We need you alive, after all...

01:47.970 --> 01:52.490
The enemy was willing
to sacrifice everything.

01:53.470 --> 01:56.490
I didn't expect the enemy to destroy
itself along with the evidence

01:56.490 --> 01:58.430
by making Titans devour itself.

02:00.640 --> 02:02.600
Retreat, men!

02:04.360 --> 02:06.060
Back into formation!

02:07.060 --> 02:09.130
Return to Karanes!

02:13.790 --> 02:14.880
Erwin...

02:14.880 --> 02:16.880
Why did you order Levi to resupply?

02:16.880 --> 02:17.970
There's no time to waste.

02:18.670 --> 02:20.170
The Female Titan was eaten.

02:20.660 --> 02:23.870
But did you see the
person inside get eaten?

02:23.870 --> 02:25.010
I didn't.

02:25.990 --> 02:27.040
You can't mean...

02:27.040 --> 02:27.810
Yes...

02:28.080 --> 02:30.650
If your original hypothesis was correct,

02:30.650 --> 02:34.670
and they can still move to a degree
after regaining human form...

02:35.750 --> 02:39.910
And if they'd equipped
Maneuver Gear in advance...

02:41.340 --> 02:45.710
The one within the Female Titan
is wearing our uniform right now.

02:46.140 --> 02:47.420
Captain Levi?

02:48.430 --> 02:49.950
No, it's not!

02:49.950 --> 02:50.630
Who are you?!

02:56.810 --> 02:57.840
Gunther!

03:05.670 --> 03:09.600
The enemy is now camouflaged
as one of our men.

04:38.093 --> 04:41.688
Sync and corrections by masaca
- addic7ed.com -

04:42.410 --> 04:47.410
Crushing Blow
57th Expedition Beyond the Walls (5)

04:49.698 --> 04:52.861
When the Colossal Titan vanished,

04:53.200 --> 04:57.090
whoever was inside had been
wearing Maneuver Gear,

04:57.090 --> 04:59.670
so that they could escape in the steam.

05:00.720 --> 05:03.050
Don't you think the same
possibility applies here?

05:03.220 --> 05:04.800
But at the time...

05:04.800 --> 05:08.010
Based on what we saw when Eren
emerged from the Titan,

05:08.010 --> 05:10.600
we concluded it would be impossible.

05:11.760 --> 05:15.390
His equipment was destroyed,
and his uniform was gone.

05:16.060 --> 05:21.350
Above all, Eren was so weak,
he couldn't even stand unassisted.

05:22.930 --> 05:27.640
The Female Titan was able to
attract other Titans with its cry.

05:28.190 --> 05:31.700
We failed to predict this,
and the operation failed.

05:32.810 --> 05:35.200
If Titan abilities vary
depending on skill,

05:35.670 --> 05:40.110
it was a mistake to use Eren, a total
novice, as the basis for our assumptions.

05:41.310 --> 05:45.860
If we are to outwit our enemy,
we'll need to think outside the box.

05:48.880 --> 05:52.260
If we're withdrawing, does that
mean the mission succeeded?

05:52.680 --> 05:58.370
If so, then we may already know who
was inside the Female Titan.

05:59.060 --> 06:01.100
I'd like to see who it is...

06:01.710 --> 06:03.960
But why was the Commander so sure

06:03.960 --> 06:07.480
that the enemy would come after
Eren if he left the walls?

06:07.480 --> 06:10.530
I think it's because, for some reason,

06:10.530 --> 06:14.140
they suddenly stopped their advance
in the midst of the last assault.

06:15.690 --> 06:18.200
Even though they managed
to break through Trost's gate,

06:18.830 --> 06:20.870
they didn't even try for the inner gate.

06:21.330 --> 06:24.040
And when Eren sealed
the gate, they let him.

06:25.290 --> 06:29.690
It could mean that they now
have bigger concerns...

06:31.070 --> 06:32.680
Bigger concerns?

06:32.680 --> 06:35.720
Something more important to
them than breaching the walls.

06:36.220 --> 06:38.470
Something unexpected that happened.

06:39.970 --> 06:41.560
Eren's transformation into a Titan?!

06:41.560 --> 06:43.270
I think it's the only answer.

06:43.600 --> 06:45.030
Then... That means...

06:45.030 --> 06:46.190
Wait... So...

06:47.610 --> 06:53.360
Someone who was there,
who saw Eren transform,

06:53.700 --> 06:55.740
is the Titan.

06:58.780 --> 06:59.830
Gunther!

07:00.290 --> 07:01.950
Eren, don't stop!

07:02.370 --> 07:03.210
Onward!

07:05.700 --> 07:07.210
But Gunther...

07:08.460 --> 07:09.500
Who's there?

07:09.500 --> 07:10.550
Protect Eren!

07:10.960 --> 07:12.380
Damn it, what do we do?

07:12.380 --> 07:14.340
Eldo, where should we go?

07:14.670 --> 07:16.300
There isn't time to reach the horses!

07:16.300 --> 07:18.260
Head for HQ, as fast as you can!

07:25.520 --> 07:28.610
Is it from the Female Titan?
Or is there more than one?

07:28.610 --> 07:29.400
Damn you...

07:29.400 --> 07:30.480
How dare you?!

07:31.130 --> 07:32.320
Come at me!

07:32.320 --> 07:33.860
I'll defeat you, even if it kills me!

07:34.400 --> 07:35.570
The Female Titan?

07:35.570 --> 07:37.450
Impossible... Why?

07:37.940 --> 07:39.870
Didn't we catch it?!

07:48.040 --> 07:52.460
If the enemy has some way
to retain its strength,

07:53.840 --> 07:57.180
it may be able to transform once more.

08:01.720 --> 08:02.890
I knew it...

08:03.050 --> 08:03.890
It's coming!

08:04.680 --> 08:06.020
The Female Titan!

08:14.570 --> 08:15.320
Damn you...

08:15.320 --> 08:16.320
How dare you!

08:16.320 --> 08:18.740
This time, I will defeat it!

08:18.740 --> 08:19.530
No!

08:21.110 --> 08:23.660
The three of us will
kill the Female Titan.

08:23.660 --> 08:26.790
You will continue to head
straight for HQ at top speed!

08:29.440 --> 08:31.590
Here's what I have gleaned
from this battle...

08:32.500 --> 08:34.900
If we only focus on
making the best moves,

08:34.900 --> 08:37.550
we will never get the
better of our opponent.

08:37.920 --> 08:40.840
When necessary, we must be
willing to take big risks,

08:40.840 --> 08:43.720
and be prepared to lose everything.

08:43.930 --> 08:45.480
I'll fight, too!

08:45.480 --> 08:46.230
No!

08:46.640 --> 08:48.310
This is the best move...

08:48.310 --> 08:50.480
Your power is too risky!

08:50.940 --> 08:54.020
What? Do you doubt us?

08:54.560 --> 08:55.840
Do you, Eren?

08:56.460 --> 08:59.570
Do you find it that hard to trust us?

09:02.070 --> 09:03.870
Unless we change how we fight,

09:04.480 --> 09:06.020
humanity cannot win!

09:12.870 --> 09:15.140
I believe my squad will be victorious.

09:16.510 --> 09:17.880
Good luck!

09:46.080 --> 09:47.410
We took its sight.

09:47.410 --> 09:50.080
For at least a minute,
it'll be in total darkness!

09:50.080 --> 09:51.330
Kill it during this time!

09:51.330 --> 09:52.670
Screw capturing it...

09:52.670 --> 09:53.460
Kill it now!

09:53.460 --> 09:54.750
Die here without honor!

09:54.750 --> 09:56.500
Make that bitch of a Titan pay!

10:00.460 --> 10:02.430
We won't let your eyes regenerate!

10:16.440 --> 10:19.070
We'll shear off so much muscle
around your shoulders,

10:19.070 --> 10:21.650
you won't be able to keep your arms up!

10:27.080 --> 10:28.080
Shear it off...

10:28.080 --> 10:29.500
Make its arms...

10:29.500 --> 10:30.660
fall!

10:33.960 --> 10:34.830
They're down!

10:37.400 --> 10:38.500
Now the neck!

10:38.940 --> 10:41.220
Shear off the muscles
that support its neck!

10:41.530 --> 10:42.880
And we can strike its weak point!

10:48.850 --> 10:50.180
They're so strong.

10:50.180 --> 10:52.390
The Female Titan is
totally on the defensive.

10:52.390 --> 10:56.060
How can they launch co-op attacks like that
without even speaking to each other?

10:57.040 --> 11:00.680
I bet it's only possible because
they believe in one another.

11:01.510 --> 11:03.720
They've overcome many
hardships that way.

11:04.280 --> 11:07.570
That's why they're so strong,
even right after losing Gunther.

11:11.050 --> 11:12.200
I'll go forward...

11:12.500 --> 11:16.190
If I go forward and believe in them,
without turning back, then...

11:16.190 --> 11:17.900
I'm sure that's the right answer.

11:18.500 --> 11:19.970
I finally understand!

11:21.920 --> 11:23.340
I don't know...

11:25.580 --> 11:26.690
I never have.

11:27.430 --> 11:29.100
I can believe in my own abilities

11:29.580 --> 11:32.270
or the choices of companions I trust.

11:33.230 --> 11:35.230
But no one ever knows
how it will turn out.

11:39.820 --> 11:42.360
Strike the neck, now!

11:47.140 --> 11:48.460
Eldo!

11:55.840 --> 11:56.710
H-How?

11:57.980 --> 11:59.670
It can't possibly see!

12:00.090 --> 12:01.840
It hasn't even been thirty seconds...

12:02.710 --> 12:03.890
Only one eye?

12:04.320 --> 12:06.840
It prioritized one eye
to accelerate the healing...

12:06.840 --> 12:09.180
Is that even possible?

12:10.110 --> 12:10.930
Petra!

12:11.050 --> 12:12.390
We need to regroup!

12:13.770 --> 12:16.230
Petra, now!

12:25.740 --> 12:26.950
Hey...

12:27.630 --> 12:28.530
Die!

12:34.830 --> 12:35.750
How?

12:36.290 --> 12:37.750
My blade can't pierce it...

12:56.180 --> 12:57.520
I...

13:01.380 --> 13:02.770
I will...

13:05.360 --> 13:06.240
I'll kill it!

13:22.120 --> 13:23.010
Eren?

13:23.900 --> 13:26.090
Wait, what? Mikasa?

13:26.270 --> 13:28.420
That voice... Don't tell me...

15:44.160 --> 15:47.883
I made the wrong choice...

15:48.770 --> 15:52.490
I wanted to believe in my companions...

15:53.340 --> 15:54.710
Because of that, everyone died!

16:04.540 --> 16:08.960
If I had believed in myself
from the start and fought...

16:09.750 --> 16:13.800
If I'd only killed it at the beginning!

16:31.190 --> 16:32.320
Back then,

16:33.490 --> 16:35.390
if I'd turned into a Titan...

16:37.570 --> 16:38.530
No...

16:39.310 --> 16:40.910
If I'd fought

16:42.790 --> 16:44.950
even before that...

16:46.720 --> 16:48.800
Captain Levi was there, too.

16:49.240 --> 16:50.830
We would have won.

16:51.290 --> 16:53.590
Maybe we could've captured it.

16:54.000 --> 16:55.710
You aren't wrong.

16:56.700 --> 16:57.930
lf you want to, do it.

17:01.500 --> 17:02.380
I...

17:03.220 --> 17:04.600
I made a choice.

17:05.930 --> 17:10.070
And it killed everyone.

17:11.650 --> 17:14.230
It's my fault they died.

17:17.190 --> 17:19.820
But despite all that...

17:20.370 --> 17:22.120
It's still your fault!

17:34.420 --> 17:36.340
I'll tear you apart...

17:37.050 --> 17:39.380
Once my hand heals,

17:39.970 --> 17:43.640
I'll rip you apart...
Tear you to shreds...

17:44.350 --> 17:47.180
Rip you into tiny pieces...

17:47.180 --> 17:49.390
And eat you!

19:49.970 --> 19:51.220
Eren!

20:13.420 --> 20:16.430
W-Wait... Eren...

20:22.510 --> 20:23.810
Don't go...

20:30.540 --> 20:31.770
Give...

20:36.120 --> 20:37.600
Give...

20:38.060 --> 20:39.560
Give Eren back!

20:57.410 --> 20:59.420
Give him back!

21:07.740 --> 21:09.730
Give him back!

21:13.390 --> 21:16.060
Why won't my blade penetrate?

21:18.390 --> 21:19.710
I know that

21:20.140 --> 21:21.060
he's alive...

21:21.960 --> 21:24.860
I know that Eren's alive!

21:26.320 --> 21:30.030
No matter where she goes, I'll kill her,

21:30.030 --> 21:32.450
rip her apart,

21:32.450 --> 21:35.790
and get you out of that filth.

21:36.560 --> 21:38.080
I'm sorry, Eren...

21:38.620 --> 21:42.380
Just wait a little longer...

21:49.760 --> 21:50.840
Wait!

21:51.440 --> 21:52.760
Wh-What are you...

21:55.100 --> 21:56.570
Fall back for now.

22:02.750 --> 22:04.210
Maintain this distance.

22:04.660 --> 22:06.420
It may be tired.

22:06.420 --> 22:08.680
It does not appear to
be going very fast.

22:10.400 --> 22:12.950
He seems to have been bit
right out of the neck.

22:13.510 --> 22:14.950
Is Eren dead?

23:53.420 --> 23:54.590
"Eren is alive."

23:55.080 --> 23:56.340
"Give Eren back."

23:57.030 --> 24:00.540
The Female Titan took Eren from
Mikasa before her very eyes.

24:00.540 --> 24:03.820
Mikasa joins forces with humanity's
strongest fighter, Levi,

24:03.820 --> 24:05.910
to challenge the Female Titan to battle.

24:05.910 --> 24:13.910
The Defeated
57th Expedition Beyond the Walls (6)
